            "label_zh": "本站简介",
            "label_en": "Introduction of this site",
            "placeholder_zh": "向你的客户简单介绍本站的用途，比如是你公司的官网或只是一个品牌知识库",
            "placeholder_en": "Provide your clients with a brief overview of the site’s purpose—for instance, whether it serves as your company’s official website or simply as a brand knowledge base",
            "value": "Xingtai GuXiao Rubber Products Co., Ltd. is a professional automotive rubber parts manufacturer , specializing in the production of high-quality rubber components for steering systems, suspension systems, drivetrain systems, engine sealing systems, and hydraulic applications .\n\nLocated in Tiankou Town, Renxian County, Xingtai City, Hebei Province, China, our factory focuses on precision manufacturing of critical rubber parts such as CV Joint Boots, Driveshaft Boots, Steering Rack Boots, Shock Absorber Boots, Stabilizer Bar Bushings, Rubber O-Rings, and Valve Cover Gaskets .\n\nWith in-depth experience in OEM & ODM custom rubber parts manufacturing , we provide both standard automotive rubber components and fully customized solutions based on drawings, samples, or application requirements.\n\nOur products are widely used for oil leak prevention, dust protection, sealing performance enhancement, and NVH reduction , helping improve vehicle reliability and service life under harsh operating conditions."
